    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/102643" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Apple Support: If you see a liquid-detection alert on your iPhone</a>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p><a href="/guides">More guides</a></p>
</ContentLayout>
